  "reason": "The evidence strongly favors scvi_n200 (RNA), multiprofile, transformer aggregation, and imagenet_vit_l (image) as the top-performing combination, with config_044 (vit_l, transformer, weighted) at 0.725 being the current best. The only untested configuration in this high-performing region is config_038 (scvi_n200, resnet50, transformer, concat). While imagenet_vit_l generally edges out resnet50, config_049 (resnet50, transformer, weighted) achieved 0.713 accuracy with the best F1 (0.695) of all experiments, suggesting resnet50+transformer is competitive. Testing config_038 completes the 2×2 grid of (resnet50, transformer) × (concat, weighted) and clarifies whether concat fusion with transformer aggregation on resnet50 could match or exceed the weighted variant. As the final experiment, this is the best exploitation choice: it uses the two strongest settings (scvi_n200, transformer) and tests the last unexplored fusion variant in the top-performing design space, maximizing the chance of finding a configuration that rivals or exceeds 0.725."
